Raise the AdaptixServer workspace floors for fixed Go modules.

The pinned upstream server still requires golang.org/x/crypto v0.48.0,
x/image v0.36.0, x/net v0.50.0, and x/text v0.34.0. Trivy reports
fixed HIGH vulnerabilities for those module lines in the compiled
adaptixserver binary, including CVE-2026-56852 fixed by x/text v0.39.0.

Updating the primary workspace module raises the versions selected by Go's
minimal version selection for the server and every extender built in the
unified Docker stage. The explicit crypto/net/sys floors match the versions
the full workspace selects alongside x/text v0.39.0. Old go.sum entries are
intentionally retained by Go 1.25.12's minimal `go get` update rather than
broadening this patch with an unrelated tidy.

